WEBVTT

00:06:29.343 --> 00:06:32.388
that was at significant risk
of being demolished.

00:06:33.264 --> 00:06:36.058
We proposed to not knock it down,

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:40.771
but instead turned it into Africa's
first major institution

00:06:40.771 --> 00:06:42.731
for contemporary African artists.

00:06:44.567 --> 00:06:45.734
(Applause)

00:06:45.734 --> 00:06:47.319
You haven't seen it yet.

00:06:47.319 --> 00:06:49.530
(Laughter)

00:06:50.531 --> 00:06:52.867
We took one of the original grain --

00:06:52.867 --> 00:06:54.410
You might get disappointed now.

00:06:54.452 --> 00:06:56.120
(Laughter)

00:06:56.162 --> 00:06:58.456
We took one of the original grains of corn

00:06:58.497 --> 00:07:00.958
that had been stored
in the original building.